    "<div class=\"metadata-header\" style=\"display:none;\">matematica|algebra|Proporcoes|Divisao Proporcional</div><div class=\"canvas-box\" data-id=\"box-17867991946400.08929706664164494\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 16.84375px; top: 30.5px; width: 750px; height: 471px; z-index: 48;  \"><h2 style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 68, 68);\">1. Divisão em partes diretamente proporcionais</span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Dividir uma quantidade em partes <strong>mantendo a mesma proporção</strong> de determinados números.</p><p style=\"line-height: 3;\">Vamos dividir <strong>R$ 600</strong> entre três pessoas em partes diretamente proporcionais a: <strong>2 : 3 : 5</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">A recebe 2 partes, B recebe 3 partes, C recebe 5 partes</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Primeiro somamos as partes: 2+3+5=10</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Agora dividimos os R$ 600 em 10 partes: 600÷10=60</p><table style=\"min-width: 75px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Pessoa</span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Proporção</span></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Valor</span></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">A</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">2 × 60 = <strong>R$ 120</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">B</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3 × 60 = <strong>R$ 180</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">C</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">5 × 60 = <strong>R$ 300</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>10</strong></span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>R$ 600</strong></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p></div>",
    "<div class=\"metadata-header\" style=\"display:none;\">matematica|algebra|Proporcoes|Divisao Proporcional</div><div class=\"canvas-box\" data-id=\"box-17867999163590.30026876349731746\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 18.84375px; top: 27.5625px; width: 755px; height: 477px; z-index: 46;  \"><h1><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 68, 68);\">2. Divisão em partes inversamente proporcionais</span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Quanto <strong>maior</strong> for o número usado na proporção, <strong>menor</strong> será a parte recebida.</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Por exemplo, vamos dividir <strong>R$ 600</strong> entre três pessoas <strong>inversamente proporcionais a 2, 3 e 5</strong>.</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">Na divisão inversamente proporcional, usamos os <strong>inversos</strong>:</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">2</span></span>​,<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">3</span></span>​,<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">5</span></span>​  →  Agora precisamos transformar isso em uma proporção com números inteiros.</p><p style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(16, 185, 129);\"><strong><em>O MMC de 2, 3 e 5 é 30:</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">2</span></span>​,<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">3</span></span>​,<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">1</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">5</span></span>​ →<span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">15</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">30</span></span>, <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">10</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">30</span></span>, <span class=\"fraction\"><span class=\"fraction-top\">6</span><span class=\"fraction-bottom\">30</span></span> → 15 + 10 + 6 = 31 partes </p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><strong><em>Cada parte vale: 600÷31≈19,3548</em></strong></p><table style=\"min-width: 100px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Pessoa</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>Número original</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>Proporção inversa</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>Valor aproximado</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>A</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>2</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>15</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><strong>R$ 290,32</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>B</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>3</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><strong>R$ 193,55</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>C</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p>6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><strong>R$ 116,13</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>Total</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><strong>31</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><strong>R$ 600,00</strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p></div>"
